teacher_info.teaching_style:
As a teacher here in Italki, I provide my students with plans to select from; 
1. Informal lessons focusing on conversational English wherein we can discuss anything you want to. If you are shy, I will always have a range of topics ready for us to talk about, which will improve your confidence and fluency in English. We can also read some articles and view selected videos to help improve comprehension skills. Homework is always optional.
2. Semi-Formal lessons centred on grammar, vocabulary and pronunciation. I will create lesson plans for you based on your level of English. We can work on essays and comprehension tasks. Business English-based lessons are also available.
